<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-24T02:26:43.535Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 02:26:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security officials in Srinagar have intensified checks, fast-tracked criminal case disposal and cracked down on drug and organised crime networks, while the police chief of Jammu and Kashmir chaired a high-level security review focusing on intelligence sharing and valley domination. In Manipur, tribal students warned of intensified agitation demanding scholarship releases and a tragic ambulance collision killed a pregnant woman. Security forces recovered a Maoist weapon dump in the Bijapur forests of Chhattisgarh and killed a suspected KCP cadre, and Lateef Bhat was killed in Kulgam. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE45UkYzTGZfeXBvMGNVcC1wbFdMdUlzTzZvSlRTSS04Q2dGNU9fM1pvbkVBSnpVVTVLX1VXVE5xY2ViRTQwRW1BUENmT19VUU1KQlNwOGhKVHE?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP Fact Check&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE0zNHZsRkhoQ1VweEFPZDlUYjhrZFlTaEtiaHROR2dKSlQyZHNqS0ZDV0xTZ2J2U3ZreFdSSk13SUlxeTNNM25FMXZsRWp6MHdqYXJoeVprRE85YmU1OW9FRGl5ZkE5QUtXdC1kNjE0VDlfZF9s?oc=5&quot;&gt;Brighter Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE1LbHYwdWx1RVdRYkN3Z0l6TWl0QWI4MXlnZFVpcC0wUHVMdFpsbUcwVTU0ZmYzWjB6eTJ2cXNTWm5kVllfYjFfT05Sa2daMDlTXzhtTllnVk9vLXI0OUdXNU9vdXp4Z0kzby1zWm41Mm9fTVJWSHQwTDdYWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Brighter Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPOHc1Z2l6S05JaGdlT1NPMjVUdGdfLUFPV1lZZnc2VU9QLTItdHhKVDRhY192d2RmU25CWmlodHB5aGpVQlg4MVhEREhQTURJdjZuTTk4ZG4wbmc4cnFtNE1vNUhPOGFXWHlLME1QSTJMTGRMR21NZ3NkVmlUMjhEVUhpNzAwSExDXy1GNGNFUlg2aHFGN2lTaE5abGYteVIxMVdWZ3prY2RkQ0xw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rising Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNSHRpVUd2T3IzMWg3ZUVLSU9KYVBnR2R